### [Setup][Admin Session] Logout admin before non-admin authorization check (204 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 204

###

### [Setup][Non-Admin Session] Login as non-admin mechanic (200 expected)
# @name Login
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{NonAdminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{NonAdminPassword}}"
}

{{
  exports.CsrfToken = response.headers['set-cookie']?.find(c => c.startsWith('autoservice_csrf='))?.match(/^autoservice_csrf=([^;]+)/)?.[1];
}}

?? status == 200

###

# CSRF token required even though this call should fail 403: without it, CsrfDoubleSubmitMiddleware would
# produce the same status before AdminOnly runs, for the wrong reason (see tests/CLAUDE.md Core Rules).

### [Negative][Register] Non-admin mechanic cannot register mechanics (403 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Blocked",
  "lastName": "NonAdmin",
  "email": "blocked.nonadmin.{{RunId}}@example.test",
  "password": "{{TestPassword}}",
  "personType": "Mechanic",
  "specialization": "GasolineAndDiesel",
  "expertise": ["Engine"]
}

?? status == 403
